<https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/generic-profile/raster-band-math/actions/data-type-2026-11-09> a rim:RegisterAction ;
    dcterms:description "The dataType of input `expression` changes from https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/data-types/data-type/string, which hid the concept, to https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/data-types/data-type/expression, created for this role in the data-types register. Its title \"String\" becomes \"Expression\"." ;
